6. Trained dictionaries
   mzip_dicts.h and train_corpus/*.bin hold zstd dictionaries trained on publicly
   available README, CHANGELOG and configuration files (the sources are listed in
   train_corpus/fetch.sh). A trained dictionary contains fragments of its training
   text, and those source files carry their own licenses, some of them GPL-2.0.
   The dictionaries are scheduled to be retrained from permissively licensed
   sources only.


